          "passage_id": "219fdcc34a59bb87a37af8c8310db7edd134ea2f91101a7f6d6ec09c97b25d49",
          "evidence_quote": "**Engineering teams.** Maintain dependency inventories, select approved components, remediate vulnerabilities, and\n\ncomply with license obligations.\n\n**Application Security.** Defines scanning gates, reviews high-risk dependencies, and blocks components with\n\nunacceptable vulnerability or provenance risk.\n\n**Legal / IP Counsel.** Approves copyleft, source-disclosure, patent, attribution, and redistribution obligations.\n\n**Procurement / Third-Party Risk.** Performs due diligence for commercially supported OSS and critical maintainers or\n\nvendors.\n\n**Developers.** May introduce OSS only through approved package-management and repository processes; they remain\n\naccountable for dependencies they add.",
